{
  "about": [
    "Which published strength standards each library exercise is rated against (mobile/tool/gen_standards.py reads it).",
    "An exercise maps to one or more pages: a string is a page on both strengthlevel.com and fitnessvolt.com; an object can name",
    "the site (sl or fv), a different FitnessVolt slug (fv), a ladder version the page's reps are of (version; of: the",
    "exercise whose ladder has it, when not this one; a version with a measured share is read by it), a scale",
    "(the library's load over the page's: 0.5 for a page that counts both hands where the library counts one) and a weight.",
    "proxy: the pages are a close cousin of the exercise, not the exercise itself (why in words).",
    "ss: a Symmetric Strength gym lift that also measures it. everyone: where untrained adults sit, as a multiple of the",
    "lifters' Beginner mark, when a population study says (default in gen_standards.py). Exercises not here are estimated."
